        CH("You bump into somebody in a crowded mall. What do you say?", ["Paumanhín pô.", "Pasintábi pô.", "Pakiraán pô."], "Paumanhín pô.", "Paumanhín pô is for bumping into someone by accident."),
        CH("Two people talking are blocking the hallway. What do you say?", ["Pakiraán pô.", "Patáwad pô.", "Paumanhín pô."], "Pakiraán pô.", "Pakiraán pô means Please let me pass."),
        CH("You want to interrupt a speaker in a meeting to make a comment. What do you say?", ["Mawaláng-gálang pô.", "Pasintábi pô.", "Patáwad pô."], "Mawaláng-gálang pô.", "It is used when one requests to be heard."),
